[TITLE]
NUM-10: 5 cfs into J0, over weir W1 into junction J1, drained by ideal pump P1
(no curve). The PUMPS section comes before WEIRS, so P1 has a lower link index
than W1. Correct result: P1 passes the 5 cfs and nothing floods.

